[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Loss가 가장 빠르게 증가하는 방향",
    "sha256": "58dc882a41bf17cd07833d16972320111af621784b3b22f4a64372f622a6dde0"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Gradient\n→ Loss 증가 방향\n\n-Gradient\n→ Loss 감소 방향",
    "sha256": "81d5e564996cb9596aa7913c4c16f479684ebf9714c2349313eff16f738bd0c4"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "import torch\n\nx = torch.tensor(3.0, requires_grad=True)\n\ny = (x**2 + 1)**2\n\ny.backward()\n\nprint(x.grad)",
    "sha256": "2887080490b29951c845dd09f7b995b90bca58aa46bd17f34e4187745610f583"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "tensor(120.)",
    "sha256": "51a216226835e810df64b75b6c497083028b994ef68c3806527d832704685dba"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "optimizer.zero_grad()\n\noutput = model(x)\n\nloss = criterion(output, y)\n\nloss.backward()\n\noptimizer.step()",
    "sha256": "b42ba89d45478b3b88ee18cd44c54e37fc23d8645799571a976ccb2b76012795"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "현재 Parameter\n      ↓\nPrediction\n      ↓\nLoss 계산\n      ↓\nGradient 계산\n      ↓\nGradient의 반대 방향으로 이동\n      ↓\n새 Parameter",
    "sha256": "ef92e8b6647be962f8eb1e1109a3ced3ce67186420187257106edbee73110649"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Learning Rate\n≈ Step Size를 결정하는 계수",
    "sha256": "1ae57cb04399382375bed42ff5ad3befaab35477b0aec26da2c2dbea9ef57e09"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Loss\n\n     ●\n    / \\\n   /   \\\n ●       ●\n      ↓\nMinimum",
    "sha256": "84f9eb9f48368de22e8b8a9ff44d17a84436428008edc8a0fd21a330773783ee"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Learning Rate 너무 큼\n       ↓\nOvershooting\n       ↓\nLoss 진동\n       ↓\nDivergence 가능",
    "sha256": "2f4f9d800a8aac628e2f596ddd0b848fe7355871e039ad0b2707c3e7a7977ea7"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Learning Rate ↓\n       ↓\nUpdate 크기 ↓\n       ↓\nTraining Time ↑",
    "sha256": "fdbdab18849069e6b7d8cc0448d31b9f15510bf8faec4a5ead46c6c344fc7aab"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Convergence가 지나치게 느려짐",
    "sha256": "fdfd2ada8ec7371813317baae3acadc96c53e78b9d6835295fa58f51b3ff09b1"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "너무 크지도 않고\n너무 작지도 않은 값",
    "sha256": "2fe3459235cb8ddd835fe97c2deb6ca6499aedeab491e82698de6eac4c1759a2"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "너무 큼\n→ 발산 가능\n\n적절함\n→ 빠르고 안정적으로 수렴\n\n너무 작음\n→ 학습이 지나치게 느림",
    "sha256": "32d68a7d5bdd2df261342f388d8901820417912c3fac896d802f2bd3dc937aba"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Training 초기\nLearning Rate 크게\n      ↓\n빠른 이동\n\nTraining 후반\nLearning Rate 작게\n      ↓\n세밀한 조정",
    "sha256": "c162b9a4d05b33ace7b296b757cdb75566e35afa0fab539291128831be87983a"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Step Decay\nExponential Decay\nCosine Annealing",
    "sha256": "2b54f495846a5a29121085ce86c74f84c78fc4cae8816e734638f45f415d5ea5"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Batch Gradient Descent\nStochastic Gradient Descent\nMini-batch Gradient Descent",
    "sha256": "fe9e7d5eeface7b1748419c7b0140e8210232746a144ac532929950463e2fe0b"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "전체 Training Data\n        ↓\nGradient 계산\n        ↓\nParameter Update 1회",
    "sha256": "60128746e622fa513a9e56eaf4b94cc2cf9725237623273d7b87da777cb572a4"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Update Direction\n→ 안정적",
    "sha256": "60349d27c637c46880f1a0e717948d312f6709906c7db478245d86ff3fcf997d"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Memory 사용량 ↑\n연산량 ↑\nUpdate당 시간 ↑",
    "sha256": "300ed7b4d47143fd9e8ad8e9fe5c4f4d40b5c78f96384e0aad8006b7d4c01431"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Sample 1\n ↓\nUpdate\n\nSample 2\n ↓\nUpdate\n\nSample 3\n ↓\nUpdate",
    "sha256": "687b8dc9271cf6be58a90af83b768108ec9bbf3b663e2293b7e2041e67558487"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Gradient Variance ↑\n      ↓\nUpdate가 크게 흔들림",
    "sha256": "e186f8231ee22b6fb4dcb22fafd93188b759d16ce0673ce8d65dfa665b8bf20c"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Batch Size = 32",
    "sha256": "5d88ec37e97803b97b3ebd007bd988c6139e1dc27a4839d4c0a12f2312727b36"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "32 Samples\n    ↓\nGradient\n    ↓\n1 Update",
    "sha256": "e180504359d30e49c6dd56a49dd4a3f263b91ed5a71ad7fd134389b60adf646a"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "8\n16\n32\n64\n128",
    "sha256": "868676aa80814b4ed46bfb93b3fbf565694c6e8bdf98b8fa5a6db19e408f5e98"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "batch_size = 32",
    "sha256": "d607968f955078f0dd3c69d6b5dfe605a67690ac1de666aeb44b81b85b207b24"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "SGD의 빠른 Update\n+\nBatch GD의 안정성\n+\nGPU Parallel Processing",
    "sha256": "1248fdc7348483fb4b607b73d062d617bf8ab3a15f88029705554122a0b66a71"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Prediction\n    ↓\nLoss Function\n    ↑\nTarget",
    "sha256": "545d2cc5aae4c8e69eb6d597b7cfaa63ac614639d25a9e46b2ef4049f1650932"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "집의 크기\n     ↓\nLinear Regression\n     ↓\n집 가격",
    "sha256": "41994baa5d46d28aa2ad6b960c27ab29019688fe5fb38bfba65e4bd805d9ab92"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Square 미분\n→ 2가 앞으로 나옴\n\n1/2\n→ 2와 약분\n\n결과\n→ 수식이 단순해짐",
    "sha256": "0ad46effb90fd9a20ea957b683e88347018471754a12a9528b5e729d9532b0ab"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Xw - y",
    "sha256": "f457f4061fec465783fcce4478f82149a43c220eb5b289c8252e9486df62f752"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Xᵀ(Xw-y)",
    "sha256": "dc99bd61e7c548b9146374f819a80c547fce9f0d2b979901a16057d60fe56f90"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Prediction\n    ↓\nError\n    ↓\nGradient\n    ↓\nLearning Rate 적용\n    ↓\nWeight Update",
    "sha256": "adbef2c18792a46b75cfeaa9d071423a8cf1d25b4de2b548d40a94c6755820cd"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Probability ≥ 0.5\n→ Class 1\n\nProbability < 0.5\n→ Class 0",
    "sha256": "2529d24174337ba7496453a6970b3ba38056c61cb210224b885d723a4ee355e7"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Linear Regression\n\nz\n↓\n그대로 Output\n↓\nContinuous Value",
    "sha256": "7423e80f66b454e067785892e35f0ea3d09292d742d89c4f14d141df5afd5098"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Logistic Regression\n\nz\n↓\nSigmoid\n↓\nProbability\n↓\nClass",
    "sha256": "08b4eff750087718fced95eb3e97c1633296c696df77bab49fc3b4f7b6a68fbc"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Perceptron\n\nLinear Score\n     ↓\nStep\n     ↓\nClass",
    "sha256": "571aabaeea94f7df0f7d29369a8b9152f7afad7e5d130e3bb1f08f257b313916"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Linear Score\n     ↓\nSigmoid\n     ↓\nProbability\n     ↓\nClass",
    "sha256": "1e581475d1c1d6297bd6c6a899e600ecaa76c93f6bac73edcff2a7317c6c13bb"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Training Data\n      ↓\nModel\n      ↓\nPrediction\n      ↓\nLoss Function\n      ↓\nGradient\n      ↓\nGradient Descent\n      ↓\nLearning Rate\n      ↓\nParameter Update\n      ↓\n다시 Prediction",
    "sha256": "1f6b30db78b1d57b81dc6fb97db700973f23db6799a922e29669f8dc9cb7e529"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Model\n→ Linear\n\nLoss\n→ MSE",
    "sha256": "117ba69dd3490c1beab8a54597775cac14c81e7936734df2b51e1141aeedf0d6"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Model\n→ Linear + Sigmoid\n\nLoss\n→ Cross Entropy",
    "sha256": "42cdaaff59b35bee739fe3e3e117f34bffec8d9027faf9d9e63eee32da8f983a"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "SGD\nMomentum\nAdaGrad\nRMSProp\nAdam\nAdamW",
    "sha256": "a7ec35181d55907bf1f0ad3480c3b03944085d9785b9b63cb9f92f5c1ba0bb64"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Machine Learning Training\n│\n├─ Model\n│   ├─ Linear Regression\n│   └─ Logistic Regression\n│\n├─ Prediction\n│\n├─ Loss\n│   ├─ MSE\n│   └─ Cross Entropy\n│\n├─ Gradient\n│\n├─ Gradient Descent\n│   ├─ Batch\n│   ├─ Stochastic\n│   └─ Mini-batch\n│\n└─ Learning Rate\n    ↓\nParameter Update",
    "sha256": "861f6e82bc2fd31b30c970c9b2a9c39e438b06cc025d54200aa8859cf2e709f0"
  }
]
